# Simulator Recovery Testing

To run the iOS app against real data in a simulator, follow the
`simulator-recovery-testing` skill and recover from a key in the gitignored
`RecoveryKeys.md`. Recovery only works on a fresh install, so uninstall the
app first. Never echo a recovery link or password anywhere.
